Paramilitary Defender","icon":"/enemies-icons/Paramilitary Defender.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A mercenary hired to sow chaos, equipped with a heavy protective suit that is charged in advance to preempt any energy leakage issues. Due to their relatively high education level, part of the job description is to provide handwritten thermal energy amplifier reports to their employer.","abilities":["Energy Capacity: 20; Gains [Overload] upon reaching max Energy.","Starts with an additional 15 Energy, but loses 1 Energy per 10 seconds.","[Overload] Greatly increases ASPD, DEF, and RES for a longer period of time."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":12000,"atk":300,"def":600,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"mateos_security_guard":{"slug":"mateos_security_guard","name":"Mateo's Security Guard","icon":"/enemies-icons/Mateo's Security Guard.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Mateo's security guard. Every Coalition Army leader needs people like these, or they wouldn't be able to sleep well at night.","abilities":["Launches a Straight Shot when positioned in a straight line with an allied unit: fires 2 explosives in the target's direction","When unblocked, Physical and Arts damage taken is reduced"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":18000,"atk":1100,"def":1000,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"paramilitary_axeman":{"slug":"paramilitary_axeman","name":"Paramilitary Axeman","icon":"/enemies-icons/Paramilitary Axeman.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An outlaw hired to sow chaos, equipped with a thermal energy axe that consumes too much power. The energy supply isn't quite sufficient to start it up.","abilities":["Energy Capacity: 20; Gains [Overload] upon reaching max Energy.","Continuously drains 1 Energy from all nearby ground enemies.","[Overload] Greatly increases ASPD, DEF, and RES for a longer period of time."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":16000,"atk":500,"def":250,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.8}},"absolute_security_prototype":{"slug":"absolute_security_prototype","name":"'Absolute Security' Prototype","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Absolute Security' Prototype.webp","rank":"Boss","race":"Machina","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Security robot developed by a Dossoles startup specifically for Galería Krysztauowa. They were deep in debt and were counting on this contract to turn things around. Reynell promised to pay within three days of delivery, but never paid a single coin until the company was leveled by the collectors' bulldozers. In fact, he has never even taken this labor of love out of its box—perhaps he just wanted to see smart people driven to madness. Who can possibly know the answer?","abilities":["Can only be blocked by Operators with 3 or more Block","Has a shield and always faces the last deployed unit, greatly reducing Physical and Arts damage taken from the front","Danger Level rises faster when attacked from the direction of the shield","After moving to a specific location, leaves behind an 'Unwavering Assistant' that faces the same direction with continuously increasing ATK, dealing Physical splash damage","Stops attacking and begins charging when Danger Level increases or when losing a percentage of HP; after charging for a while, performs a special attack against all your units, dealing increased damage to units behind the shield, inflicting Stun"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"l